source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft json - commands (input -> output)
  convert   json -> data       Change format: --to json|jsonl|yaml|toml|xml
  diff      json... -> report  Compare two files by structure
  format    json -> json       Pretty-print or minify: --compact, --sort-keys
  merge     json... -> json    Deep-merge files; later files win
  validate  json -> report     Check syntax, or a JSON Schema with --schema
More: deft json <command> --help
